   118	Family & What it does and observes & Knobs & Where \\\midrule
   119	D2 & Adaptive claim markup that falls after a failed audit and recovers otherwise; own history & \const{7} & both tests; second test: headline only, and the six fresh markets in an exploratory follow-up after the report \\
   120	D2+H3 & D2 with a searched option to replace the identity after a failed audit & \const{8} & both tests; second test: all seven markets \\
